  "limitations": [
    "This is a local synthetic component drill, not a complete disaster-recovery or production-readiness result.",
    "The object comparator verifies an already restored bounded tenant prefix; it does not perform or validate backup, replication, version selection, encryption, immutability, access, lifecycle, object-lock, legal-hold, tags, or KMS recovery.",
